+HP ini tidak punya gyro asli, jadi gerakannya dihitung dari sensor lain dan bisa terasa sedikit tertunda. Kehalusan tinggi meredam goyangan; turunkan bila terasa berat.	This phone has no real gyro, so its motion is calculated from other sensors and can feel slightly delayed. High smoothing calms the shakiness; lower it if it feels sluggish.
